      <incoming>Id_a8687ec0-1475-4507-b764-b8484f4f3a8a</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_c331c2ae-316f-4a54-9ba5-873c5be4b9c8</outgoing>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_f14cebe5-a65b-4a47-a470-fac00857c95d" name="5.5.3 Test the project's information production methods and procedures">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.5.3 se concentra em garantir que os m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos para a produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es sejam compreendidos por todos os membros da equipe de entrega e possam ser implementados desde o in&amp;iacute;cio das atividades de gera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es. Isso envolver&amp;aacute; o teste dos m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es do projeto.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Testar e documentar m&amp;eacute;todos e procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Refinar e verificar se a estrutura anal&amp;iacute;tica proposta do cont&amp;ecirc;iner &amp;eacute; vi&amp;aacute;vel;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Desenvolver recursos compartilhados para serem usados pe&amp;ccedil;a equipe de tarefa; e&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. Comunicar os m&amp;eacute;todos e os procedimentos de produ&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o da informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o do projeto para todas as equipes de tarefas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_cd400e04-e502-4ee7-b4e5-330f0bf91a53</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_3731e6db-44d6-44a4-956e-708f0379af7b</outgoing>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_19a8c89f-a3d1-41af-b1ab-2f6a5e4f5b71" name="5.5.2 Mobilize information technology">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Este item trata da mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de tecnologia, tanto de hardware quanto de software. Ela abrange o ambiente comum de dados (CDE) e qualquer outra tecnologia que sustente a gera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es especificamente. A atividade de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o deve resultar na instala&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o, configura&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e teste adequado da tecnologia para apoiar a gera&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e a troca de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es entre todos os membros da equipe do projeto. Isso &amp;eacute; para garantir que as informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es possam ser trocadas com confian&amp;ccedil;a entre os membros da equipe de entrega e entre as partes contratada e contratante&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Adquirir, implementar, configurar e testar software, hardware e infraestrutura de TI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Configurar e testar o ambiente comum de dados (CDE) do projeto&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Teste as trocas de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es entre as equipes de tarefas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;4. TEste a entrega de infomra&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o com a contratante.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_9d49928d-58c1-4809-b131-aef9a2d2e8f9</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_eb6a1598-49c7-4cab-93a3-1cf52ac9ca54</outgoing>
      <ioSpecification id="Id_414c8071-c9f9-4d31-8974-3a168f28a675">
        <dataInput id="Id_34a32183-3773-4623-bb99-e23d60873993">
