    <task id="Id_bb0599e2-6857-44fd-9ea6-dd4a708fa2ab" name="5.5.1 Mobilize resources">
      <documentation>&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;A atividade de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o deve resultar em indiv&amp;iacute;duos dispon&amp;iacute;veis, instru&amp;iacute;dos e treinados de modo que possam gerar informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es e fornecer o modelo de informa&amp;ccedil;&amp;otilde;es para autoriza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e aceita&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o.A mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de recursos abrange tr&amp;ecirc;s atividades principais que est&amp;atilde;o definidas na cl&amp;aacute;usula 5.5.1.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;1. Confirmar a disponibilidade dos recursos de cada equipe de tarefas;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;2. Desenvolver e realizar forma&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;3. Desenvolver e realizar treinamentos.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Ex.: Haver&amp;aacute; ocasi&amp;otilde;es em que os membros da equipe pretendidos n&amp;atilde;o estar&amp;atilde;o mais dispon&amp;iacute;veis quando o contrato come&amp;ccedil;ar. Essa situa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o precisa ser gerenciada, identificando e aprimorando os novos membros da equipe para substitu&amp;iacute;-los.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;Importante: certifique-se de que o tempo de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o definido no plano seja realmente alocado para planejamento e a implementa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de treinamento.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Revisar o plano de mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Revisar cada TIDP&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Estabelecer a disponibilidade de indiv&amp;iacute;duos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Implementar educa&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o e treinamento conforme necess&amp;aacute;rio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Atualizar o registro de riscos conforme necess&amp;aacute;rio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="text-align:left;text-indent:0pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-family:Arial;font-size:9pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;"&gt;&amp;bull; Repetir a mobiliza&amp;ccedil;&amp;atilde;o de recursos como e quando necess&amp;aacute;rio&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</documentation>
      <extensionElements>
        <bizagi:BizagiExtensions xmlns:bizagi="http://www.bizagi.com/bpmn20">
          <bizagi:BizagiProperties>
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="bgColor" value="#E5B9B7" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="borderColor" value="#956967" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textColor" value="#000000" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textBackgroundColor" value="Transparent" />
            <bizagi:BizagiProperty name="textDirection" value="" />
          </bizagi:BizagiProperties>
        </bizagi:BizagiExtensions>
      </extensionElements>
      <incoming>Id_015d5b51-0822-4109-8137-25aa4f91b323</incoming>
      <outgoing>Id_9d49928d-58c1-4809-b131-aef9a2d2e8f9</outgoing>
    </task>
    <task id="Id_a18c5444-9d67-4f10-a152-0c7e92ee9aed" name="5.5.2 e) Report failures">
